00:10:07,317 --> 00:10:10,387
Let me put the whole airport together.

294
00:10:10,467 --> 00:10:13,227
Your ticket carries a facility charge.

295
00:10:13,227 --> 00:10:16,037
The airlines pay rent and landing fees.

296
00:10:16,037 --> 00:10:17,695
Your car pays for parking,

297
00:10:17,695 --> 00:10:19,727
rentals or a pickup.

298
00:10:19,727 --> 00:10:22,239
The terminal collects from every shop and

299
00:10:22,239 --> 00:10:23,677
every screen.

300
00:10:23,677 --> 00:10:26,207
And federal grants fill in the rest.

301
00:10:26,207 --> 00:10:27,001
Five streams,

302
00:10:27,001 --> 00:10:30,337
all flowing into one public owner.

303
00:10:30,584 --> 00:10:33,892
So why do America's airports make money

304
00:10:33,892 --> 00:10:35,594
before you fly?

305
00:10:35,824 --> 00:10:37,640
Because an airport is not just a

306
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,644
runway.

307
00:10:38,754 --> 00:10:39,974
It is a landlord,

308
00:10:39,974 --> 00:10:41,609
a parking operator,

309
00:10:41,609 --> 00:10:43,863
a shopping mall and a toll collector,

310
00:10:43,863 --> 00:10:45,084
all at once.

311
00:10:45,234 --> 00:10:48,131
And every one of those businesses gets

312
00:10:48,131 --> 00:10:50,063
paid long before your wheels leave the

313
00:10:50,063 --> 00:10:50,904
ground.

314
00:10:51,144 --> 00:10:52,662
So next time you land,

315
00:10:52,662 --> 00:10:53,814
look around.

316
00:10:53,814 --> 00:10:54,731
The garage,

317
00:10:54,731 --> 00:10:56,117
the rental counter,

318
00:10:56,117 --> 00:10:57,269
the coffee shop,

319
00:10:57,269 --> 00:10:59,044
the screens on the wall.

320
00:10:59,114 --> 00:11:00,917
Each one is part of how the

321
00:11:00,917 --> 00:11:02,436
airport pays its bills,

322
00:11:02,436 --> 00:11:05,611
long before anyone checks a boarding pass.

323
00:11:05,850 --> 00:11:08,269
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

324
00:11:08,269 --> 00:11:11,154
we follow the money behind another hidden

325
00:11:11,154 --> 00:11:13,530
link of the world economy.

326
00:11:13,750 --> 00:11:16,150
This is The Hidden Economics.
